[break] give-back-expands-the-editors-chips
rule: A prompt given back goes after what the editor holds, whose chips stay chips.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::give_back
find: let mut now = self.input.editor().fragment();
replace: let mut now = Fragment::text(self.input.editor().expanded());
caught-by:
    app::tests::sessions::a_prompt_given_back_keeps_the_editors_chips

[break] the-command-lines-command-is-a-prompt
